连接。视觉引导线由发带、衣襟、手部动作自然延伸，引导视线由上至下，由外及内，最终聚焦于她含笑的唇与温润的眼眸。光影柔和，主光源来自左上方，勾勒出面部轮廓与发丝边缘，同时在衣褶与饰品上形成微妙高光，营造出“柔光如纱”的氛围。整体色调以蓝、白、青为主，冷暖交织，赋予画面清冷雅致又不失温婉的东方美学意境。\n\n提示词：一位古典汉服少女，发髻高挽饰蕾丝珠花，青丝垂落缀淡蓝小花，耳坠翡翠，颈间银链垂翠玉，身着内外双层衣裳，外衫轻纱内衬深蓝绸缎，腰系淡紫丝带，袖口绣云纹，右手轻抚胸前，腕戴银镯翠坠，姿态温婉，眼神清澈含笑，背景为幽蓝林间薄雾，枝叶斜垂遮挡肩头，光影柔美，冷暖色调交织，营造梦幻空灵的东方古典氛围，构图中近景特写，视觉引导自然流畅，画面细腻如工笔，充满诗意与故事感。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 395, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 258, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [530], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [301.73602294921875, 106], "pos": [-262.9829406738281, 676.7601318359375], "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "link": 545, "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "id": 265, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [527, 538], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [306.7352600097656, 133.5447540283203], "pos": [-277.7978515625, 907.0911865234375], "widgets_values": ["UltraFlux-v1_model.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 254, 